<title>USA: American Electromedics FY96 shr rises.</title>
<headline>American Electromedics FY96 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Electromedics Corp said Tuesday that its fiscal 1996 earnings rose to $0.04 from the previous fiscal year figure of $0.02 per share.</p>
<p>The company reported revenues of $2.4 million and net income of $172,000 for the fiscal year ended July 29. It said there were 11,192,419 weighted average shares outstanding.</p>
